        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学解答 - 函数与零点问题</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #7a2a2a;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 20px 40px;\n    max-width: 900px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .graph-placeholder {\n    float: right;\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 190px;\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #fdfdfd;\n  }\n  .center-line {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n\n  <div class=\"graph-placeholder\">[Diagram: 函数图像，展示两曲线 y=b 与 x₁, x₀, x₂ 三个交点，坐标轴 x, y]</div>\n\n  <p>令 $F(a)=\\ln a-\\dfrac{a-1}{a+1}$；$F(1)=0$</p>\n\n  <p class=\"center-line\">$F'(a)=\\dfrac{1}{a}-\\dfrac{2}{(a+1)^{2}}=\\dfrac{a^{2}+1}{a(a+1)^{2}}>0$</p>\n\n  <p>$\\therefore F(a)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上递增，$a=1$</p>\n\n  <p>(2)先画图分析：</p>\n\n  <p>由(1)知,$f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,0)\\searrow,(0,+\\infty)\\nearrow$</p>\n\n  <p>$g(x)$ 在 $(0,1)\\searrow,(1,+\\infty)\\nearrow$</p>\n\n  <p>要有三个交点则必是如右所示,考场中可用零点存在定理说明一下,两函数在$(0,1)$上有一个交点$x_0$。</p>\n\n  <p>由题知:</p>\n\n  <p>$g(x_1)=g(x_0)=f(x_0)=f(x_2)$</p>\n\n  <p>$e^{x_0}-x_1=e^{x_0}-\\ln x_0=x_2-\\ln x_2\\cdots\\ast$</p>\n\n  <p>$x_1&lt;0,\\ 0&lt;x_0&lt;1,\\ x_2&gt;1$</p>\n\n  <p>$e^{\\ln x_0}-x_1=e^{\\ln x_0}-\\ln x_0;\\ x_2-\\ln x_2=e^{x_2}-e^{\\ln x_2},\\ ,e^{x_2}&gt;1$</p>\n\n  <p>即 $g(x_1)=g(\\ln x_0),\\ x_1,\\ln x_0&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_1=\\ln x_0$；同理 $f(x_2)=f(e^{x_0})\\Rightarrow x_2=e^{x_0}$</p>\n\n  <p>$x_1+x_2=\\ln x_0+e^{x_0}=2x_0$ 由(*)式可得。</p>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
